{%- comment -%}
  Renders a flag emoji for a 2-letter ISO country code (falls back to a
  globe for anything not in this short list -- extend as new markets are
  added in Shopify admin). No arithmetic-on-codepoints trick here since
  Liquid has no way to do that; a plain case statement is the simplest
  thing that can't silently render the wrong flag.
  Usage: {% render 'country-flag', iso_code: country.iso_code %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case iso_code -%}
  {%- when 'US' -%}🇺🇸
  {%- when 'CA' -%}🇨🇦
  {%- when 'GB' -%}🇬🇧
  {%- when 'AU' -%}🇦🇺
  {%- when 'DE' -%}🇩🇪
  {%- when 'FR' -%}🇫🇷
  {%- when 'ES' -%}🇪🇸
  {%- when 'IT' -%}🇮🇹
  {%- when 'NL' -%}🇳🇱
  {%- when 'MX' -%}🇲🇽
  {%- when 'BR' -%}🇧🇷
  {%- when 'IN' -%}🇮🇳
  {%- when 'JP' -%}🇯🇵
  {%- when 'SE' -%}🇸🇪
  {%- when 'NO' -%}🇳🇴
  {%- when 'IE' -%}🇮🇪
  {%- when 'NZ' -%}🇳🇿
  {%- else -%}🌐
{%- endcase -%}
